Description: linus desktop environment meta-package
 This meta-package pulls in the complete linus desktop: the mantle Wayland
 shell, the sway Wayland compositor (with Hyprland available as an
 alternative session), the greetd display manager and gtkgreet greeter,
 the PipeWire audio stack, NetworkManager, UPower, xdg-desktop-portal,
 a curated set of fonts, and a minimal default application set (foot
 terminal, Firefox ESR browser, Thunar file manager).
 .
 Installing this package on a Debian trixie system with the linus apt
 repository configured produces a complete, working linus desktop.
 Removing this meta-package leaves all installed components in place;
 only the dependency anchor is removed — the desktop continues to function.
